,"id":"msg_009c33354ed2ca2b016b06b474956887d1bb4d3810a72d4d66","role":"assistant","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"{\"queries\":[],\"result_json\":\"{\\\"intention\\\":\\\"Keep a safe berry reserve and recover energy, then collect a small hazelnut sample and seek an evidence-based way to assess it without eating an unidentified food.\\\",\\\"steps\\\":[{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"eat\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"resource:berry\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":1}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.satiety\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"lt\\\",\\\"value\\\":85}},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"rest\\\",\\\"args\\\":{}} ,\\\"repeat\\\":5,\\\"until\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":39},\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"navigate\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"start-1-nuts\\\",\\\"x\\\":15.4,\\\"y\\\":14.5}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"gather\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"target\\\":\\\"start-1-nuts\\\",\\\"quantity\\\":2}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":20}},{\\\"action\\\":{\\\"interface\\\":\\\"request\\\",\\\"args\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Assess an unfamiliar food sample safely\\\",\\\"function\\\":\\\"Investigate an owned hazelnut sample using feasible non-ingestive observation or trials, to establish whatever evidence is obtainable about edibility, processing requirements, and nutritional usefulness while explicitly retaining unresolved uncertainty.\\\",\\\"conditions\\\":\\\"I have observed a mature hazelnut plant near (15.4,14.5), with five units visible at tick 15. Its nutrition, toxicity, and processing requirements are unknown to me. I intend to collect two units. Berries are my known-safe alternative.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"An actually owned hazelnut sample, if collection succeeds; any other necessary tools or materials must be specified and acquired.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, time, energy, materials, and learning requirements are unknown; determine a feasible limited procedure.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Produce only findings supported by actual examination or trials. Do not guarantee safety from appearance, confer mastery through this request, or require ingestion of an unassessed sample.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":null}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The tick-15 probe revealed plant state, not hazelnut food safety.\\\",\\\"Keep berries available; do not eat hazelnuts on the strength of their name or appearance.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Maintain food and energy reserves while making room for exploration.\\\",\\\"Prefer limited, evidence-producing trials over unsafe ingestion.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"local-foods\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Which nearby foods can safely support an independent life?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Initial knowledge identifies berries as providing 8 nutrition with zero toxicity.\\\",\\\"At tick 15 my inventory contains seven berries.\\\",\\\"The tick-15 observational probe found the hazelnut plant mature with stock five; it did not establish edibility.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"Hazelnut nutrition, toxicity, and processing requirements remain unknown.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Maintain a practical safe-food reserve and investigate another local food.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Gathered berries and ate one.\\\",\\\"Observed the hazelnut plant directly.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Known-safe berry reserve.\\\",\\\"Recorded hazelnut plant-state observation.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A collected hazelnut sample and a feasible method for assessing its food properties.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Recover energy, collect two hazelnuts, and request a limited non-ingestive assessment 